{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在《2026香港小姐競選》第二輪泳裝面試，憑一句無厘頭「番茄醬牛腩麵」一夜爆紅的25歲百萬網紅溫思婷，雖然大熱倒灶未能成功晉級，但人氣不跌反升！重返老本行專注網紅事業的她日前大派福利，曬出一輯火辣健身自拍；其「邪惡俯拍視角」令傲人上圍呼之欲出，隨即引發網民暴動！</p><figure><img alt=\"溫思婷。（IG@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187407243167928320680725.jpeg/0yyszgt0E6_aO6lUCiq5EKOGg142_uGlhduOE4XbjhM\"/><figcaption>溫思婷。（IG@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日前曬出一輯火辣健身自拍。（IG@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187405958104485888248750.jpeg/zKYOxHWu4cdmxtGqjN_bkqzNAVc6_AcDgD_EJIA_xCQ\"/><figcaption>日前曬出一輯火辣健身自拍。（IG@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure><p>憑「番茄醬牛腩麵」爆紅</p><p>事緣溫思婷早前面試港姐時，因無厘頭爆出一句「番茄醬牛腩麵」瞬間化身網絡迷因，喜感十足的發言甚至驚動荷里活華裔喜劇演員歐陽萬成（Jimmy O. Yang），特意拍片二創惡搞、神還原該搞笑片段，令她一路紅到海外！雖然自帶頂流話題的她最終止步於第二輪面試（未能入圍12強決賽），但落選絲毫無損其號召力，火速回歸網紅老本行後人氣更加居高不下。</p><figure><img alt=\"歐陽萬成（Jimmy O. Yang）都「學埋一份」。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187410137195745280698517.jpeg/acmj_amK-QymcW6NSTEnQGULSHJSuOwFSpy4hkqcuIY\"/><figcaption>歐陽萬成（Jimmy O. Yang）都「學埋一份」。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"積極更新動態。（IG@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187404952041951232397548.jpeg/4YHUIq2MGCCO9-QPWApqEIt6mO1MLIfZ1ZCsyNWQrMg\"/><figcaption>積極更新動態。（IG@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"回歸網紅路。（IG@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187404584075661312463197.jpeg/47fc0xs3LHdcNmP7INs5x9Z6tvuiqU5TsXkXHbF5Fx0\"/><figcaption>回歸網紅路。（IG@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure><p>粉色瑜伽服自拍騷S形身段</p><p>日前她以「Gym time」為題分享運動靚相。相中所見，留著一頭俐落齊瀏海短髮的溫思婷俏麗迷人，身穿奶白色極細吊帶運動內衣，下身搭配超緊身淺粉色瑜伽褲。超貼身剪裁將其玲瓏浮凸的S形身段展露無遺，而最讓一眾網民狂噴鼻血的，莫過於她由上而下的近距離「邪惡俯角」自拍，豐滿上圍在超低領口下幾近破衣而出，超深邃誘人的「深長事業線」震撼眼球，火辣魔鬼身材無所遁形，令留言區瞬間淪陷失控！</p><figure><img alt=\"邪惡視角俯拍。（IG@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187404754410541056741682.jpeg/Hf-pqeowwr0C_McIWNIXnytzIpn1_XMrVdGI2VXRiNk\"/><figcaption>邪惡視角俯拍。（IG@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"極具殺傷力。（IG@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187405625080942592092613.jpeg/iHdL2PFQyu1Lr88toTkogl6z7B9klffdji79_o4u_f4\"/><figcaption>極具殺傷力。（IG@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"S形曲線展露無遺。（IG@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187405221593092096317806.jpeg/Ty_8QqkyszxpornP1KiDMO_BNuvEu2ApWoqc11qKnNc\"/><figcaption>S形曲線展露無遺。（IG@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T15:40:49.529088+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":705,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:30:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T16:37:39.458410+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T15:38:13.218954+00:00","content_hash":"6247b4cb1d56b471673851ff05563bdf1a447f73f9f18953301df6996bb46a16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}